# CRITICAL: live container data dirs (postgres, uptime-kuma) live INSIDE the
# repo tree at infra/data/. They MUST be git-ignored — otherwise prod-deploy.sh's
# `git stash push -u` stashes the live postgres data dir mid-write, which trips
# "data directory lock file is invalid" → immediate shutdown + WAL recovery on
# EVERY deploy (root cause of the infra-postgres-1 restart loop, 276 restarts).
infra/data/
